  "note": "Election of the aldermen and councillors of Newtownards Borough Council on 21 May 1958, reported ward by ward. Each of the four wards returned one alderman; Castle, Victoria and Glen also elected three councillors, while Scrabo's three councillors were unopposed. H. Cavan was also nominated and not elected, but no vote is printed for him; he is omitted."
